[[File:BobaFettDais-BoBFCh1.jpg|thumb|right|250px|A hoversled was used at Boba Fett's Palace]]
A '''hoversled''',<ref name="Bloodline">[[Bloodline (novel)|''Bloodline'']]</ref> also known as a '''gravsled''',<ref name="Smuggler's Guide">''[[Star Wars: Smuggler's Guide]]''</ref> was a type of [[repulsorlift]] transportation or to carrying large quantities of cargo.

During the [[High Republic Era]], [[Myarga Anjiliac Atirue]] the Benevolent, a [[Hutt]] who was a member of the [[Hutt Clan|Hutt Cartel]], used a hoversled for transportation and battle.<ref name="THR8">[[The High Republic (2021) 8|''The High Republic'' (2021) 8]]</ref> The [[Katikoot]] species used a [[Katikoot hoversled|design of hoversled]] for transportation in their underground city of [[Diurna]] on the planet [[Aubadas]].<ref name="Quest for the Hidden City>''[[The High Republic: Quest for the Hidden City]]''</ref> [[Jabba the Hutt's dais|A large hoversled]] acted as a throne inside [[Boba Fett's Palace|the palace]] of the Hutt crime lord [[Jabba Desilijic Tiure]]<ref name="RotJ">{{Film|VI}}</ref> and later [[Bib Fortuna]] and [[Boba Fett]].<ref name=Rescue">{{TheMandalorian|Chapter 16: The Rescue}}</ref> Them Twenty-four [[Standard year|years]] after the formation of the [[New Republic]], [[Senator]] [[Ransolm Casterfo]] unwittingly ruined [[Leia Skywalker Organa Solo|Leia Organa's]] sting operation of [[Rinnrivin Di]]'s [[Rinnrivin Di's cartel|cartel]] when he attempted to "rescue" her in a hoversled.<ref name="Bloodline" />

